# AI-Powered Traffic Control System

## Overview
The AI-Powered Traffic Control System is designed to monitor and manage city traffic using artificial intelligence. The system aims to reduce congestion, improve emergency vehicle response times, and enhance road safety by dynamically adjusting traffic signals based on real-time data.

## Project Goals
- Analyze live traffic data using AI models.  
- Reduce waiting times at traffic signals.  
- Provide priority routes for emergency vehicles.  
- Improve overall traffic efficiency and reduce pollution.

## System Features
- Real-time traffic monitoring through sensors or cameras.  
- Smart signal timing controlled by AI algorithms.  
- Emergency vehicle detection and fast lane clearance.  
- Data visualization dashboard for traffic authorities.

